@startuml state-game
title Goose Patrol - Game State Machine (v2, A1 implementation)
[*] --> Paused : game launched\n[FR_START_PAUSED]
Paused --> Running : P / ESC
Running --> Paused : P / ESC, or window\nloses focus [FR_PAUSE]
Running --> Lost : timer reaches 0\n[FR_TIMER_EXPIRE]
Running --> Won : geese dispersed >= 8\n[FR_WIN_CONDITION]
Running : timer, geese, player, events\nand spawning update every frame
Paused : nothing updates;\npause overlay shown
Won --> [*] : EndScreen [FR_END_SCREEN]\n(R starts a new game)
Lost --> [*] : EndScreen [FR_END_SCREEN]\n(R starts a new game)
@enduml
